   "subject": "Re: 關於gsub regex",
   "parts": [
    [
     1,
     "<div dir=\"ltr\">Hi Iris,<div><br></div><div>本例可參考正規表示式 Regular Expressions 的使用:</div><div><br></div><div>1. grepl 正規表示式邏輯值判斷, 結果為TRUE/FALSE, 第1個參數為pattern, 表示判斷條件, 第2個參數為輸入值.</div><div><br></div><div>2. grepl 之pattern用法 <font size=\"6\">&quot;<font color=\"#ff0000\">\\\\(</font>.<font color=\"#6fa8dc\">*</font><font color=\"#ff00ff\">?</font><font color=\"#00ff00\">\\\\)</font>&quot; </font><font size=\"2\">, 執行結果為判斷資料是否有左右括號, 例:第2個元素pass_names[2]包括</font><span style=\"font-size:small\">(Florence Briggs Thayer).</span></div><div><div style=\"background-color:rgb(250,250,250);border-color:rgb(187,187,187);border-style:solid;border-width:1px;word-wrap:break-word\"><code><div><div># <font color=\"#ff0000\">\\\\(</font> : 包括 ( 符號</div><div># .   : 任何單一字元(matches any single character)</div><div># <font color=\"#6fa8dc\">*</font>   : 包括至少零次,即可以不符合(matches at least 0 times)</div><div># <font color=\"#ff00ff\">?</font>   : 包括最多一次(matches at most 1 times)</div><div># <font color=\"#00ff00\">\\\\)</font> : 包括 ) <span style=\"font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif\">符號</span></div></div></code></div><br></div><div>3. gsub(&quot;^.*?\\\\((.*?)\\\\)$&quot;, &quot;\\\\1&quot;, name), 本例執行完成會保留( ) 之內容.</div><div><div style=\"background-color:rgb(250,250,250);border-color:rgb(187,187,187);border-style:solid;border-width:1px;word-wrap:break-word\"><code><div><div># ^   : matches the start of the string.</div><div># $   : matches the end of the string.<br># \\\\1 : 符合條件資料表示( ) 之內容, 其內容可以使用第1個參考條件表示, 即 \\\\1</div></div></code></div><br>4. gsub(&quot;^(.*?),\\\\s[a-zA-Z\\\\.]*?\\\\s(.*?)$&quot;, &quot;\\\\2 \\\\1&quot;, name), 本例中第1個元素pass_names[1]符合此條件, 即啟始字元是, 且結束是 . 的字元,  &quot;Braund<span style=\"background-color:rgb(255,255,0)\"><font size=\"4\">, Mr. </font></span>Owen Harris&quot;. <font color=\"#ff0000\" size=\"4\">&quot;\\\\2 \\\\1&quot;</font> 表示符合此2個條件之字串, 先以第2個, 再第1個順序表示, 中間以空白串接, 此稱為  backreference.</div><div><div style=\"background-color:rgb(250,250,250);border-color:rgb(187,187,187);border-style:solid;border-width:1px;word-wrap:break-word\"><code><div><span><font color=\"#666600\">\\\\s : 空白符號</font><br><font color=\"#666600\">a-zA-Z: 英文大小寫字母</font><br><font color=\"#666600\"># try following:</font><br><font color=\"#666600\">gsub(&quot;^(.*?),\\\\s[a-zA-Z\\\\.]*?\\\\s(.*?)$&quot;, &quot;\\\\2 \\\\1&quot;, pass_names[1])</font><br><font color=\"#666600\"># end</font></span></div></code></div></div><div><br></div><div>5. 參考資料:</div><div><div style=\"background-color:rgb(250,250,250);border-color:rgb(187,187,187);border-style:solid;border-width:1px;word-wrap:break-word\"><code><div><div>?regex</div><div># <a href=\"http://stat545.com/block022_regular-expression.html\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=http://stat545.com/block022_regular-expression.html&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1793237619488000&amp;usg=AOvVaw0a-TP3bgKKloyPxisffkco\">http://stat545.com/block022_regular-expression.html</a></div></div></code></div></div><div><br>Iris於 2017年7月13日星期四 UTC+8上午4時12分45秒寫道：</div></div>"
    ],
    [
     3,
     "<div dir=\"ltr\"><div><blockquote class=\"gmail_quote\" style=\"margin:0;margin-left:0.8ex;border-left:1px #ccc solid;padding-left:1ex\">\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"background-image:initial;background-position:initial;background-repeat:initial\"><span style=\"font-size:12pt\">各位好，</span><br></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\">想請問一個簡單問題，關於gsub的regular expression, 下面黃底這些語法的解釋？謝謝！</p><p class=\"MsoNormal\">題目是：需要重新整理乘客名稱，去掉title：</p><p class=\"MsoNormal\"><br></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"background:white\"><span style=\"font-family:Helvetica;color:#3a3a3a\">The </span><span style=\"font-size:10.0pt;font-family:Courier;color:#3a3a3a;background:#ebf4f7\">pass_names</span><span style=\"font-family:Helvetica;color:#3a3a3a\"> vector that you worked with\r\nbefore is already preloaded. For men, the overall format is like before. For\r\nwomen, however, there is only a female title, but then the name of her spouse.\r\nThe first two elements in </span><span style=\"font-size:10.0pt;font-family:Courier;color:#3a3a3a;background:#ebf4f7\">name</span><span style=\"font-family:Helvetica;color:#3a3a3a\"> show this:</span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"background:#ebf4f7\"><span style=\"font-size:10.0pt;font-family:Courier;color:#333333\">&gt; pass_names[1:2]</span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"background:#ebf4f7\"><span style=\"font-size:10.0pt;font-family:Courier;color:#333333\">[1] &quot;Braund, Mr. Owen\r\nHarris&quot;</span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"background:#ebf4f7\"><span style=\"font-size:10.0pt;font-family:Courier;color:#333333\">[2] &quot;Cumings, Mrs. John\r\nBradley (Florence Briggs Thayer)&quot;</span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom:7.5pt;background:white\"><span style=\"font-family:Helvetica;color:#3a3a3a\">Suppose we want to change men&#39;s\r\nnames to a modern format, without a title, and change the women&#39;s names to only\r\ninclude their own name, like this:</span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"background:#ebf4f7\"><span style=\"font-size:10.0pt;font-family:Courier;color:#333333\">&gt; clean_pass_names[1:2]</span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"background:#ebf4f7\"><span style=\"font-size:10.0pt;font-family:Courier;color:#333333\">[1] &quot;Owen Harris&quot;</span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\">\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n<span style=\"font-size:10.0pt;font-family:Courier;color:#333333\">[2] &quot;Florence Briggs Thayer&quot;</span>    <br></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\"><br></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\"><br></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\">convert_name &lt;- function(name) {</p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\">  # women: take name from inside parentheses</p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\">  <span style=\"background-color:rgb(255,255,0)\">if (grepl(&quot;\\\\(.*?\\\\)&quot;, name)) {</span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"background-color:rgb(255,255,0)\">    gsub(&quot;^.*?\\\\((.*?)\\\\)$&quot;, &quot;\\\\1&quot;, name)</span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"> </p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\">  # men: take name before comma and after title</p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\">  } else {</p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\">    # Finish the gsub() function</p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\">    <span style=\"background-color:rgb(255,255,0)\">gsub(&quot;^(.*?),\\\\s[a-zA-Z\\\\.]*?\\\\s(.*?)$&quot;, &quot;\\\\2 \\\\1&quot;, name)</span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\">  }</p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\">}</p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"> </p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"></p></blockquote></div></div>"
    ]
   ]
